{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.human.statblock.human-apprentice-mage","title":"Человек-ученик мага","chapter":"23. Бестиарий","group":"Люди","path":"Monsters/monster/human/statblock/human-apprentice-mage.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.human.statblock/human-apprentice-mage","originalName":"Human Apprentice Mage","originalDescription":"|             Human, Humanoid             |         -         |     Level 2      |                Minion Controller                | EV 4 for four minions |\n|:---------------------------------------:|:-----------------:|:----------------:|:-----------------------------------------------:|:---------------------:|\n|             **1M**<br>Size              |  **5**<br>Speed   | **4**<br>Stamina |               **0**<br>Stability                | **2**<br>Free Strike  |\n| **Corruption 2, psychic 2**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |        -         | **+5 bonus to ranged distance**<br>With Captain |   **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|             **0**<br>Might              | **+1**<br>Agility | **0**<br>Reason  |               **0**<br>Intuition                |  **+2**<br>Presence   |\n\n> 🏹 **Lightning Strike (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Magic, Ranged, Strike** |                          **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ranged 10**          | **🎯 One creature or object per minion** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 2 lightning damage\n> - **12-16:** 3 lightning damage\n> - **17+:** 5 lightning damage\n>\n> **Effect:** If the apprentice mage doesn't use a maneuver or a move action this turn, the target is also [slowed](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/slowed) (EoT).\n\n> ⭐️ **Supernatural Insight**\n>\n> The apprentice mage ignores concealment if it's granted by a supernatural effect.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/human/statblock/human-apprentice-mage.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"human","recordType":"statblock","level":2,"ev":"4 for four minions","size":"1M","keywords":["Человек","Гуманоид"],"role":"Контроллер","organization":"Миньон"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.human.statblock.human-apprentice-mage"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.human.human-malice"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.group.human","title":"Люди"},{"id":"monsters.monster.human.human-malice","title":"Раздор людей"},{"id":"monsters.rule.monster.malice","title":"Раздор"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.human.statblock.human-apprentice-mage","kind":"monster","name":"Человек-ученик мага","markdown":"| Человек, Гуманоид | - | Уровень 2 | Миньон, Контроллер | Боевая ценность 4 за четырёх миньонов |\n|:-----------------:|:---:|:---------:|:------------------:|:--------------------------------------:|\n| **1M**<br>Размер | **5**<br>Скорость | **4**<br>Выносливость | **0**<br>Устойчивость | **2**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **Порча 2, Психический 2**<br>Иммунитет | **-**<br>Движение | - | **+5 к дальности дистанционных атак**<br>С капитаном | **-**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **0**<br>Мощь | **+1**<br>Ловкость | **0**<br>Разум | **0**<br>Интуиция | **+2**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> 🏹 **Молниеносный удар (Знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Магия, Дальний, Удар** |                          **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Дальний 10**         | **🎯 По одному существу или объекту на каждого миньона** |\n>\n> **Бросок силы + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 2 урона молнией\n> - **12-16:** 3 урона молнией\n> - **17+:** 5 урона молнией\n>\n> **Эффект:** если ученик мага в этот ход не использует манёвр или действие движения, цель также получает состояние [Замедление](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.slowed) (КсХ).\n\n> ⭐️ **Сверхъестественная проницательность**\n>\n> Ученик мага игнорирует сокрытие, если оно вызвано сверхъестественным эффектом.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.human.statblock.human-apprentice-mage","path":"Monsters/monster/human/statblock/human-apprentice-mage.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.human.statblock/human-apprentice-mage","originalName":"Human Apprentice Mage","originalDescription":"|             Human, Humanoid             |         -         |     Level 2      |                Minion Controller                | EV 4 for four minions |\n|:---------------------------------------:|:-----------------:|:----------------:|:-----------------------------------------------:|:---------------------:|\n|             **1M**<br>Size              |  **5**<br>Speed   | **4**<br>Stamina |               **0**<br>Stability                | **2**<br>Free Strike  |\n| **Corruption 2, psychic 2**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |        -         | **+5 bonus to ranged distance**<br>With Captain |   **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|             **0**<br>Might              | **+1**<br>Agility | **0**<br>Reason  |               **0**<br>Intuition                |  **+2**<br>Presence   |\n\n> 🏹 **Lightning Strike (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Magic, Ranged, Strike** |                          **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ranged 10**          | **🎯 One creature or object per minion** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 2 lightning damage\n> - **12-16:** 3 lightning damage\n> - **17+:** 5 lightning damage\n>\n> **Effect:** If the apprentice mage doesn't use a maneuver or a move action this turn, the target is also [slowed](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/slowed) (EoT).\n\n> ⭐️ **Supernatural Insight**\n>\n> The apprentice mage ignores concealment if it's granted by a supernatural effect.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/human/statblock/human-apprentice-mage.json","sourceRevision":"b